From 7ca10cd8fda67f9ecfea7d925ada2078208df79e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 21:28:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v2.3.5: nvram defaults and dictionaries for this rung

Groundwork for the four changes that follow, kept in one commit because the
defaults table and the 25 dictionaries are shared by all of them.

nvram:
  rwarden_stats_save  1     persist Warden block statistics to /jffs
  rwarden_reset       off   retention window: off | 24h | 7d | 30d | 90d
  upnp_protect_svc    1     refuse UPnP/PCP mappings on the router's own ports
  upnp_min_port_ext   1024  was 1 - see the UPnP commit; the code's own comment
                            already promised 1024 but the branch was unreachable
  reaper_fbdone       0     operator escape hatch for the first-boot gate

i18n: RWDN_56..68 + RDST_64 (Warden statistics card, retention picker, the
"counting since" line, and the Storage page's not-saved state), RFB_15/16
(first-boot step 2), all translated across the 24 languages rather than
English-seeded. RWDN_46 and RDST_20 are rewritten - their old text described
the pre-fix behaviour and would have been actively wrong. Dicts stay lockstep
at 6312 lines; reaper_langcheck reports 0 breakers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
